    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2139" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγιᾰλός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sea-shore, beach</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.422
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.385
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.50
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.7
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.4.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.13.8
			</span></i> (pl.), etc.; distinguished from 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				547a10
			</span></i>; also in <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
