				425
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IA</u>
				210
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγιαλὸν ἔνδον τρέφει</span>
			<i>a whole beach of voting-pelbles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				110
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγιαλῷ λαλεῖς</span>,
			of deaf persons, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zen.
				1.38
			</span></i>. (Prob. connected with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγίς</span> II, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴξ</span>
		IV.)</div>
